<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Prudential starts Lamar.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Prudential starts Lamar.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Prudential analyst James Marsh said he started Lamar Advertising with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- He declined to provide further details immediately.</p>
<p>-- E. Auchard, Wall Street bureau, 212-859-1736</p>
